# LF in every checkout, Windows included: Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, and the tests read
# requirements.lock's bytes (no CR) and the release workflow reads datapiler/__init__.py with sed (a CR stops its
# match). Windows PowerShell 5.1 and PowerShell 7 both read LF scripts.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.exe binary
*.ico binary
*.res binary
*.sqlite binary
